Package: driverman
Version: 1.0.13
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Jaime <info@inled.es>
Depends: libc6, libstdc++6, pciutils, hwdata, python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, polkitd, pkexec, x-terminal-emulator
Description: GPU driver manager for Pulsar OS.
 Detects the installed GPU and manages its driver packages through apt-get,
 with a CLI (driverman) and a dark GTK front-end (driverman-gui). If a
 package install hits a dependency conflict, the user keeps control of a
 terminal to resolve it manually.
